\title{plasticdb: client for the PlasticDB API}
\description{
PlasticDB (\url{https://v2.plasticdb.org}) is a curated database of
microorganisms and proteins linked to plastic biodegradation, and of the
evidence behind each link. This package reads it: catalogue tables as
tibbles, sequences as \link[Biostrings:AAStringSet]{Biostrings::AAStringSet}s, and files on disk.
}
\details{
