a dataset release, then \code{\link[=proteins_list]{proteins_list()}}, \code{\link[=microorganisms_list]{microorganisms_list()}},
\code{\link[=plastics_list]{plastics_list()}}, \code{\link[=papers_list]{papers_list()}}, \code{\link[=evidence_interactions]{evidence_interactions()}} and
\code{\link[=search_hits]{search_hits()}}. \code{\link[=provenance]{provenance()}} says what answered, and \code{\link[=cite]{cite()}} how to
cite it. Errors are classed conditions: see \link{plasticdb-conditions}.

